@startuml
' BrewLite – Deployment-01 (Task 3.2)
' Nguồn: docs/architecture/architecture.md, apps/api/Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml, .github/workflows/ci.yml
' Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/architecture/diagrams/deployment.puml
title BrewLite – Deployment diagram (Production, CI, Local)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Customer\n(Khách hàng)" as Customer

rectangle "PRODUCTION" {
  node "User Device (Browser/PWA)" as UserDevice {
    artifact "PWA Shell (browser cache)\nmanifest · service worker · app shell" as PwaShell
  }

  node "Vercel (Next.js Web + CDN)" as Vercel {
    artifact "Next.js Web (PWA)\nNext.js 16 · HTTPS 443" as WebArtifact
  }

  node "Render Web Service (NestJS API Container)" as RenderApi {
    artifact "NestJS API\nDocker image từ GHCR · port 3000" as ApiArtifact
    component "Mock Payment Provider" as MockPay
    component "Health endpoints\n/health · /health/ready" as HealthArtifact
    ApiArtifact --> MockPay
    ApiArtifact --> HealthArtifact
  }

  node "Render Managed PostgreSQL\n(Persistent storage)" as ManagedDb {
    database "PostgreSQL Database\nPostgreSQL · schema public" as Database
  }
}

rectangle "CI – GitHub Actions" {
  node "GitHub Actions (CI/CD)" as CI {
    artifact "ci.yml\npnpm lint · test · build\nDocker build + push" as CiArtifact
  }
  node "GitHub Container Registry (GHCR)" as Registry {
    artifact "ghcr.io/<owner>/<repo>/api\n:sha-<commit> · :latest" as ImageArtifact
  }
}

rectangle "LOCAL – Developer Machine" {
  node "Developer Machine (Docker Compose)" as Local {
    artifact "docker-compose.yml\nweb:3001 · api:3000 · db:5432\nPostgreSQL volume: pgdata" as ComposeArtifact
  }
}

Customer --> UserDevice : sử dụng
UserDevice --> Vercel : HTTPS 443
UserDevice --> RenderApi : HTTPS 443\nREST/JSON + JWT
ApiArtifact --> Database : PostgreSQL 5432\ninternal URL + SSL
CI --> Registry : push image (HTTPS)
Registry --> RenderApi : pull image (HTTPS)
CI ..> RenderApi : deploy hook (HTTPS)
Local ..> CI : git push / pull request

legend right
  **Cổng / giao thức**
  HTTPS công khai: 443 · API container: 3000 (PORT)
  PostgreSQL: 5432, chỉ internal URL + SSL
  **Secret / environment**
  Render Dashboard: DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET, CORS_ORIGIN, ...
  Vercel: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL (không phải secret)
  GitHub Secrets: RENDER_DEPLOY_HOOK_URL, API_HEALTH_URL
  Local: .env (không commit); chỉ dùng .env.example
  **Health check / log**
  Render health check: GET /health/ready (tần suất theo dashboard)
  Docker HEALTHCHECK: GET /health mỗi 30 giây
  Logs: Render Dashboard · Vercel Dashboard · GitHub Actions · docker compose logs
  **Trạng thái**
  Production: KẾ HOẠCH (chưa deploy)
  CI: workflow có trong repo, chưa chạy trên GitHub
  Local: đã verify docker compose build/up
endlegend

@enduml
